{"1410450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ten Deadly Games: Jamsepticeye", "steam_appid": 1410450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, it's late at night, and you open up your backlog folder. You choose ten games and start playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten Deadly Games is a collection of games from different developers based around the same theme - &quot;Death is an Opportunity.&quot; Experience slow-burn horror in &quot;D.I.M.&quot;, score-based physics mayhem in &quot;Fishin' Critical&quot;, puzzle challenges in &quot;More for Me,&quot; a bittersweet narrative in &quot;Until Then&quot;, and more! Ten Deadly Games is a celebration of the variety and creativity of indie game developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Man's Draw</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A western-themed FPS in which dying gives you a chance to progress to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grim Was the Acre</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous character sketch with lots of witty dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoping for a Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A slow-paced and surprisingly heartfelt puzzle game about a goblin finding the homes of deceased humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organ Donor Delivery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A game about goofy, fast-paced optimization while you're trying to box and deliver organs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mitten's Descent</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A quick and addictive rougelike-platformer hybrid about dodging threats and upgrading when you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More for Me</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A cute and clever side-scrolling puzzle game about using your lives to create opportunities to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D.I.M.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A slow-burn and thought-provoking horror game about interacting with a very concerning AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishin' Critical </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A sloppy and silly score-cruncher about a fish trying to steal items off of a fishing boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until Then</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A bittersweet look into the thoughts of a dying individual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grave Intentions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A goofy game about wooing a woman at her relative's funeral.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, it's late at night, and you open up your backlog folder. You choose ten games and start playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten Deadly Games is a collection of games from different developers based around the same theme - &quot;Death is an Opportunity.&quot; Experience slow-burn horror in &quot;D.I.M.&quot;, score-based physics mayhem in &quot;Fishin' Critical&quot;, puzzle challenges in &quot;More for Me,&quot; a bittersweet narrative in &quot;Until Then&quot;, and more! Ten Deadly Games is a celebration of the variety and creativity of indie game developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Man's Draw</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A western-themed FPS in which dying gives you a chance to progress to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grim Was the Acre</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous character sketch with lots of witty dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoping for a Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A slow-paced and surprisingly heartfelt puzzle game about a goblin finding the homes of deceased humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organ Donor Delivery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A game about goofy, fast-paced optimization while you're trying to box and deliver organs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mitten's Descent</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A quick and addictive rougelike-platformer hybrid about dodging threats and upgrading when you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More for Me</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A cute and clever side-scrolling puzzle game about using your lives to create opportunities to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D.I.M.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A slow-burn and thought-provoking horror game about interacting with a very concerning AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishin' Critical </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A sloppy and silly score-cruncher about a fish trying to steal items off of a fishing boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until Then</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​A bittersweet look into the thoughts of a dying individual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grave Intentions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A goofy game about wooing a woman at her relative's funeral.</p>", "short_description": "Ten Deadly Games is a collection of games from different developers based around the same theme - &quot;Death is an Opportunity.&quot; These ten deadly games were all created in a week for the Jamsepticeye game jam.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410450/9f65b2c8bbed71b9632746155e456ad587a0eabb/header.jpg?t=1763660017", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410450/9ef761ab0d2f9d01ba9dfafe1ae49a62dab6ecac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763660017", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410450/9ef761ab0d2f9d01ba9dfafe1ae49a62dab6ecac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763660017", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "